From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:06:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): cross-gateway project tree drops remote copies
 of sessions the active gateway already places [daveey]

nous-1's projects.tree also lists MacBook sessions; lacking the /Users/...
folder it files them under Home, so the merged sidebar showed the chat twice:
the live local row (kanban badge, stripe) and a frozen remote copy in Home
with no kanban counts. The active gateway's placement now wins; a remote
project emptied by the dedupe is dropped.
